{'symbol': 'ALK', 'date': '2021-12-29 00:29:00', 'title': "WINTER WEATHER IMPACTS - WHAT TO KNOW IF YOU'RE FLYING ON ALASKA AIRLINES", 'text': "SEATTLE, DEC. 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WINTER WEATHER, DISPLACED CREW MEMBERS AND AIRCRAFT, AND THE CONTINUED IMPACT OF THE OMICRON VARIANT ON STAFFING LEVELS ARE CONVERGING TO CAUSE\xa0MORE CANCELED AND DELAYED FLIGHTS\xa0FOR ALASKA AIRLINES THIS WEEK. TODAY, 170 FLIGHTS WERE CANCELED ACROSS ALASKA'S NETWORK, WITH\xa0MORE CANCELLATIONS AND DELAYS EXPECTED THROUGHOUT THE WEEK."}